# Buildroot users table (see Buildroot manual "Makeusers syntax").
# Neither account can log in ("*").
#   pico  runs PICO-8: display, render, input and audio devices only.
#         Owns the PICO8DATA partition (saves, carts).
#   pico8cfg runs only the PICO8-OS settings cart (from a fresh copy of the
#         read-only original, in /run/pico8os/cfg). Only it can send the
#         agent settings-cart requests and read the status it writes back.
#   www   runs the web UI (busybox httpd -u www). Group of the PICO8DATA
#         partition (read/write) and of /run/pico8os/priv, through which it
#         asks pico8os-agent (root) for privileged actions. pico is NOT in
#         the www group, so carts cannot reach that channel.
pico 1000 pico 1000 * /home/pico /bin/sh video,audio,input,render PICO-8 player
www 1001 www 1001 * - - - PICO8-OS web UI
pico8cfg 1002 pico8cfg 1002 * - /bin/sh video,audio,input,render PICO8-OS settings screen
